### 🆕 Create a new booking
POST http://localhost:5000/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "areaId": 1,
  "startDateTime": "2025-11-20T10:00:00.000Z",
  "endDateTime": "2025-11-20T12:00:00.000Z"
}

###

### 🆕 Create another booking (different area and time)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "areaId": 2,
  "jobId": null,
  "startDateTime": "2025-11-21T08:00:00.000Z",
  "endDateTime": "2025-11-21T10:00:00.000Z"
}

###

### 📄 Get all bookings
GET http://localhost:5000/api/bookings
Accept: application/json

###

### 📄 Get bookings filtered by areaId
GET http://localhost:5000/api/bookings?areaId=1
Accept: application/json

###

### 📄 Get bookings filtered by status
GET http://localhost:5000/api/bookings?status=Pending
Accept: application/json

###

### 📅 Get bookings within a date range
GET http://localhost:5000/api/bookings?from=2025-11-20T00:00:00.000Z&to=2025-11-22T00:00:00.000Z
Accept: application/json

###

### 🔍 Get a single booking by id
GET http://localhost:5000/api/bookings/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 🔍 Try invalid booking id
GET http://localhost:5000/api/bookings/abc
Accept: application/json
